  "releaseNotes": "0.7.0: checked against 420 real-world TIFF files; reads more of what libtiff reads (strip arrays as libtiff reads them, predictor 2 for floating point, palette with alpha, Group 4 palettes), YCbCr tags as libtiff reads them, EditMetadata fixes for IFD loops and truncated files; earlier files decode unchanged. Requires PictureSharp 0.7.10. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp.Tiff/blob/v0.7.0/docs/releases/release-0.7.0.md",
